# Intentionally minimal TWRP board init.
#
# The stock init.recovery.ums9230_nico.rc imports init.recovery.common.rc,
# which starts the stock Unisoc USB/configfs gadget and vendor services. That
# conflicts with TWRP's own init.recovery.usb.rc. Keep this board-specific file
# present for init's ro.hardware import, but let TWRP own service and USB setup.
